    "title": "Whose: asking who owns something",
    "pattern": "Whose + noun + is / are + this / these?",
    "meaningZh": "询问物品是谁的",
    "meaningEn": "Asking who owns an identified thing",
    "explanation": "whose询问所属关系，可以放在名词前：Whose shirt is this?也可以独立使用：Whose is this?问单件物品用is，多件物品用are。whose不是who’s；后者是who is或who has的缩写，不能直接放在shirt前询问主人。回答时可以使用人名所有格或mine、hers等物主代词。",
    "usage": "找到不确定归属的衣物时，用whose问清主人。",
    "nuance": "Whose jacket is this询问主人，不询问穿着者是谁。Whose本身不指明单复数，数量由后面的名词与be体现。",
    "structure": [
      "Whose + singular noun + is + this?",
      "Whose + plural noun + are + these?",
      "Whose + is / are + this / these?"
    ],
    "formation": [
      "Whose + singular noun + is + this?",
      "Whose + plural noun + are + these?",
      "Whose + is / are + this / these?"
    ],
    "examples": [
      {
        "target": "Whose shirt is this?",
        "zh": "这件衬衫是谁的？"
      },
      {
        "target": "Whose socks are these?",
        "zh": "这些袜子是谁的？"
      },
      {
        "target": "Whose is this jacket?",
        "zh": "这件夹克是谁的？"
      },
      {
        "target": "Whose are these shoes?",
        "zh": "这些鞋是谁的？"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "学习目标：找到不确定归属的衣物时问清主人。",
      "等级为教学编排，不代表官方穷尽清单。"
    ],
    "commonMistakes": [
      {
        "wrong": "Who’s shirt is this?",
        "correct": "Whose shirt is this?",
        "explanation": "询问所属关系使用whose；who’s是who is或who has的缩写。"
      }
    ],
    "comparison": [
